es:\n\n- Rework of in-game editor\n\n\n\n\n\nAdded:\n\n- Editor: Banners (capture points), units spawners, gates, minor elements like trees, boxes etc.\n\n\n\nImproves:\n\n- AI improve (choosing target, archers aiming, decide of important objective as gate or banner to take)\n\n- Weapons are no longer weight-based\n\n- UI Pointer have now fixed position while holding a weapon\n\n\n\nFixes:\n\n- Colliders on house model on \u201cDefend our village\u201d map\n\n- In some cases when NPC fallen down, he could die with no reason\n\n- Hurt audio position is now more accurate\n\n- Blocking arrows by weapons will now make sound\n\n- Colliders on map City Ciege\n\n- Player pose on map Siege walls", "created_date": 1687812058, "id": "6404192659619984", "version": "0.9", "version_code": 4, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "6305464276159490", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "6404192659619984"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "260680633179710"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1685988445, "id": "6328587137180537", "version": "0.82", "version_code": 3, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "6305464276159490", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "6404192659619984"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_r